---
source: crates/tui/tests/snap_composer.rs
expression: text(&view.lines)
---
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── peer-crew ─
❯ /
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Session
  /clear                        Start a fresh chat with the lead. Runs keep going
  /resume                       Pick an earlier conversation or a run to carry on
  /exit                         Close the screen. Runs keep going
  /compact                      Summarize the conversation to free context
  /rename                       Rename the conversation
  /branch                       Start a new conversation from here and keep this one
  /fork                         Copy the conversation into a new background session
  /btw                          Ask a side question that stays out of the conversation
  /recap                        One line on where the conversation stands
  /copy                         Copy the last answer, or the nth from last
  /export                       Save the conversation as plain text
  /cd                           Work in another folder. No path shows the current one
